  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あの、すみません。\nもしかして、Beitのみなさんですか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "店員A"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "えっ？　はい、そうですけど……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "やっぱり！　この展示を担当したの、自分なんです！\nデビューしたときから、Beitのファンで……！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "店員A"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "わぁ、そうなの！？　本人に会えて嬉しいよ！\n……って、恭二、どうしたの？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あ、いや……。\n俺たちのファンって、ホントにいたんだなって。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "こうして目の前で見るの、初めてなんで……。\n今更ですけど、ようやく実感してきたっていうか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あはは。自分がアイドルだっていう実感？\nまあ、その気持ちは分かるかも。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺だって、アイドルとしての期間より、\nアイドルのファンをやってる期間のほうが長いしね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あの、よろしければ、こちらの展示の\n写真を撮らせて頂けないでしょうか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はい、もちろんです！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "店員A"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "せっかくなので、展示のどこかに\nサインをさせてもらってもいいですか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ボクも、ボードと写真撮りたい！\n並んで撮っても、いい？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "は、はい！\n是非お願いします！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "店員A"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "本当にありがとうございました！\nサインも大切に飾らせていただきます！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "店員A"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ボクも、ありがとー！\n写真撮影、楽しかった！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
        "step_index": 26,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 26
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "店員さん、すみません。撮った写真を\n事務所のブログに載せる件なんですが……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-28:text",
        "step_id": 28,
        "step_index": 27,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 27
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "責任者に聞いたところ、\n問題ないとのことでしたので、是非！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "店員A"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-29:text",
        "step_id": 29,
        "step_index": 28,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 28
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "やったね。たくさんの人に、\nこの素敵な展示を見てもらえるよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_c:step-30:text",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 47,
          "target_step_index": 29
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "数日後……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
